            <formatted-text>
              <run>Overview of predictions, segments and feature/driver importances for the model that analyses and predicts a QC reorder after a customer has placed their first order.

Sheet Segmentation - shows customer counts and average reorder predictions per chosen segment per country.

Sheet Feature Importance - shows absolute feature importances compared across all focus markets.

Sheet Feature Shapley Values - shows feature/driver importances on individual customers. Allows for comparison of effects per single feature or combination of features for different order behaviour situations.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
